---

<section class="terminal-hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-left">
      <p class="eyebrow">
        <span class="eyebrow-line"></span>Segurança ofensiva &amp; code review
      </p>
      <h1>
        Hackers são<br />
        <span class="word-accent">piratas</span> do código
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-desc">
        Escrevo sobre secure code review, pentest whitebox e exploração de
        vulnerabilidades reais — compartilhando conhecimento em português para
        fortalecer a comunidade.
      </p>
      <a class="hero-cta" href="/blog/"
        >Ler o blog <span class="arrow">↗</span></a
      >
    </div>

    <div class="terminal-window">
      <div class="titlebar">
        <span class="dot dot-r"></span>
        <span class="dot dot-y"></span>
        <span class="dot dot-g"></span>
        <span class="terminal-title">PARAD0X // WHOAMI</span>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <span class="rl rl-sys">&gt; SISTEMA: BLOG PIRATA v3.0</span>
        <span class="rl rl-sys">&gt; IDENTIFICANDO OPERADOR...</span>
        <span class="rl rl-dim">&nbsp;[████████████████████] 100%</span>
        <span class="rl rl-green">&gt; OPERADOR: PARAD0X — ALLAN TRINDAD</span>
        <span class="rl rl-empty"></span>
        <span class="rl rl-white">&gt; ESPECIALISTA EM SEGURANÇA OFENSIVA.</span
        >
        <span class="rl rl-white">&gt; CODE REVIEW, DEVSECOPS E ARQUITETO.</span
        >
        <span class="rl rl-empty"></span>
        <span class="rl rl-sys">&gt; MISSÃO: DISSEMINAR CONHECIMENTO.</span>
        <span class="rl rl-sys">&gt; CERTIFICAÇÕES: OSCP · DCPT · EHPX</span>
        <span class="rl rl-empty"></span>
        <span class="rl rl-green"
          >&gt; BEM-VINDO AO BLOG PIRATA.<span class="t-cursor">_</span></span
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .terminal-hero {
    padding: var(--space-16) 0;
  }
  .hero-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-16);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
  }
  .eyebrow-line {
    width: 28px;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), transparent);
  }

  .hero-left h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, var(--text-5xl));
    font-weight: var(--fw-regular);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
  }
  .word-accent {
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold);
    background: linear-gradient(
      120deg,
      var(--c-green-400),
      var(--c-green-500) 45%,
      var(--c-green-300)
    );
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .hero-desc {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 42ch;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-8);
  }

  .hero-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-6);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--text-on-accent);
    font-weight: var(--fw-semibold);
    box-shadow: var(--glow-accent);
    transition:
      background-color 0.15s ease,
      box-shadow 0.15s ease,
      transform 0.15s ease;
  }
  .hero-cta:hover {
    background: var(--accent-hover);
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(79, 180, 24, 0.45);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .hero-cta .arrow {
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }
  .hero-cta:hover .arrow {
    transform: translate(2px, -2px);
  }

  .terminal-window .terminal-title {
    margin-left: var(--space-2);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .terminal-window .body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    line-height: 2;
    min-height: 300px;
  }
  .rl-sys {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .rl-white {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
  }
  .rl-green {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .rl-dim {
    color: var(--c-grey-600);
  }
  .rl-empty {
    height: 0.5em;
  }
  .rl-accept {
    color: var(--accent-strong);
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold);
    text-shadow: var(--glow-accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .hero-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-10);
    }
  }
</style>
